  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plan numbered 793 RDP P01 REV B received on 17 May 2011 submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The waste and recycled materials storage arrangements shown on the approved drawing shall be completed within three months of the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 4 - No later than six months from the date of this decision notice, the flats hereby approved shall be modified to comply with the current Building Regulations, specifically Approved Document Part E 'resistance to the passage of sound' where they currently fail to do so.",
    "Condition : 5 - The access doorway to the flats shall have a minimum clear width of 900mm, a level surface or ramp between the pavement and the floor and a door handle not more than 1m above ground level.",
    "Condition : 6 - The forecourt of the building shall not be used for car parking until the layout shown in approved drawing 793 RDP P01 REV B received on 17 May 2011 has been completed and the associated footway crossover has been constructed.  A visibility splay 2.4 m wide and 2.4 m deep shall be provided on each side of the access so far as this is possible within the land controlled by the applicant, the depth is to be measured from the back of the footway and the widths outwards from the edges of the access, and no fence, wall or other obstruction to visibility exceeding 0.6m in height above the surface of the adjoining highway shall be erected within the areas of such splays."
  ],
